# Cloudflare Pages SPA fallback.
#
# The app is a client-side router (TanStack Router, code-based routes), so the
# only real HTML document is index.html. Without this rule a hard refresh or a
# shared link on any route other than "/" — /dashboard, /<username> —
# asks Pages for a file that does not exist and gets a 404 instead of the app.
#
# 200 (rewrite), not 302: the browser keeps the original URL so the router can
# read it and render the right route.
/*    /index.html   200
